# Community Scout Configuration
#
# No API keys or OAuth credentials needed.
# Both meetup.com and lu.ma are accessed via the Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Web Search Tool,
# a fully managed MCP connector backed by Amazon's web index.
# The Web Search Tool is priced at $7 per 1,000 queries; new AWS accounts receive Free Tier credits.
#
# To use a non-default Bedrock model, set the model ID below.
# Otherwise, the Scout will use us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514.

# Amazon Bedrock Foundation Model ID for query interpretation and response formatting.
# Any Bedrock model ID supporting tool use may be substituted.
# Model ID is read at handler invocation time; changing it does not require restarting the runtime.
# Default: us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514
BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514
